OL,3,ADemocrats take control of US Congress
OL,4,Aas voters reject Trump's Republicans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Democrats win the Senate and the
OL,7,FHouse in US midterm elections, taking
OL,8,Fcontrol of Congress for the rest of
OL,9,FDonald Trump's presidency
OL,11,FTrump says the Democrats "did a good
OL,12,Fjob" - and acknowledges the Iran war,
OL,13,Fand higher fuel prices, played a part
OL,14,Fin the defeat
OL,16,FIn the Senate race, Democrats picked up
OL,17,Fa string of victories in Republican
OL,18,Fstrongholds, including Texas, Ohio, and
OL,19,FKansas - which last elected a Democrat
OL,20,Falmost 100 years ago
